只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A DeepSeek Harness plugin and AI skill for Figma-style canvas design. Generates, previews, and iterates multi-frame UI drafts directly from chat, storing living design specifications as clean HTML files version-controlled in Git.","id":"gh:1338402054","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-canvas-design-harness","slug":"askman-dev/dsh-canvas-design-harness","topics":["dsh-plugin","skill","skills"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness plugin and AI skill for Figma-style canvas design. Generates, previews, and itera"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"tes multi-frame UI drafts directly from chat, storing living design specifications as clean HTML fil"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"es version-controlled in Git."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Canvas Design Harness for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> 🎨 **Interactive Figma-style canvas design plugin & dual-spec Skill for DeepSeek Harness.**\n> Creat"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"e, inspect, and iterate on multi-frame UI designs directly inside DeepSeek Harness Web GUI, while re"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"maining 100% standalone for Codex, Claude Code, and terminal workflows."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 📸 Visual Overview"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"🖼️ 1. Design Gallery (Grid Overview) — Browse all workspace design documents"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"🎨 2. Multi-Frame Canvas (Grok Mobile App) — Infinite canvas with responsive device frames"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"📊 3. Living Specs (AI Apps Comparison) — Multi-page design specs version-controlled in Git"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 🌟 Key Highlights"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 1. Integrated \"Design Gallery\" in DeepSeek Harness UI\n- Seamlessly mounts into the `conversation"},{"id":"p10s2","text":".view` tab ring (alongside Chat and Trajectory).\n- Instant visual gallery of all design documents lo"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"cated in `docs/designs/`.\n- Embedded full-height interactive viewer with zoom, pan, and real-time ho"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"cs/designs/`.\n- Embedded full-height interactive viewer with zoom, pan, and real-time hot-reloading."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 2. HTML as Universal Living Specifications\n- **Human-Friendly**: Clean, readable HTML files (`do"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"cs/designs/*.html`). Double-click to open in any standard web browser without heavy proprietary desi"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"gn software.\n- **AI-Friendly**: Standard semantic DOM structure. LLMs can inspect, generate, and per"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"form atomic mutations on frames and components with 100% precision.\n- **Git-Native Specs**: Design f"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"iles live right in your repository as code. Commit, branch, diff, and review living design specifica"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"tions alongside your application code."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 3. Figma-Like Interactive Canvas Experience\n- Multi-page document architecture with infinite pan"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"/zoom canvas.\n- Built-in device frame presets (Mobile, Desktop, Modals, Flow diagrams).\n- Zero-depen"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"dency built-in HTTP-MCP daemon (`127.0.0.1:9321`) handles live synchronization and SVG exports."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 4. Dual-Spec Package\n- **DeepSeek Harness Plugin**: Declares `dsh.bundle.patch` & `dsh.client` f"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"or complete host-and-client GUI integration.\n- **Codex / Claude Code Skill**: Self-contained skill e"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ngine at `.agents/skills/canvas-design-harness/`, ready to run standalone."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 🚀 Quick Start"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 1. Install into DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"#### Option A: Direct Git Install (Recommended)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Install directly from GitHub into your DSH Web profile:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"#### Option B: Local Clone (For Development)"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"#### Restart Web Profile"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"After installation, restart the DSH Web profile in your terminal:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Refresh your browser (`http://127.0.0.1:3080`), and you will see the **Design Gallery** (`设计大厅`) tab"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" in the top navigation ring."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### 2. Conversational Design Generation"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"1. **Describe your UI in chat**:\n> *\"Design a user login and registration interface for me with mobi"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"le screens\"*\n2. **Automatic Generation**: The Agent invokes `canvas_harness_*` tools to generate and"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" render design files under `docs/designs/`.\n3. **Inspect in Design Gallery**: Open the **Design Gall"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"ery** tab to view your interactive canvas."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 🏗️ Repository Layout"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 🛠️ Model Tools Bridge"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The plugin exposes the following structured tools to the AI model (addressed by `root` + `name`):"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose | MCP Method |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| `canvas_harness_ensure_workspace` | Probe/spawn daemon & register workspace | `POST /workspaces` |"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"\n| `canvas_harness_list_designs` | List all `.html` designs in workspace | `workspace.listFiles` |\n|"},{"id":"p32s3","text":" `canvas_harness_create_design` | Create a new design HTML document | `document.createFile` |\n| `can"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"vas_harness_get_document` | Read and parse the document node tree | `document.getDocument` |\n| `canv"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"as_harness_batch` | Atomically apply batch operations on frames/components | `batch` |\n| `canvas_har"},{"id":"p32s6","text":"ness_validate` | Validate document structure and frames | `document.validate` |\n| `canvas_harness_sc"},{"id":"p32s7","text":"reenshot` | Render frames to SVG without a browser | `node.getScreenshot` |\n| `canvas_harness_mcp_ca"},{"id":"p32s8","text":"ll` | Raw MCP JSON-RPC escape hatch | `tools/call` |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## 💻 Development & Acceptance"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Run the three-step acceptance suite after making any changes:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Standalone Skill (Codex / Claude Code)"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The skill can also run independently without DeepSeek Harness:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"MIT License"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
